OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do veterinary fees and sausage
OL,4,Arolls vary in price across London?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHave you ever wondered why the same
OL,7,Fitem costs more or less depending on
OL,8,Fwhere in London you buy it?
OL,10,FTake a bog standard Greggs' sausage
OL,11,Froll for example. If you buy it in an
OL,12,Fouter London borough like Sutton, it
OL,13,Fcosts #1.35. But if you buy it in
OL,14,Fcentral London you're likely to pay
OL,15,F#1.60.
OL,17,FYou might have guessed that the price
OL,18,Fdifference, according to Greggs, is
OL,19,Foften about location.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
