OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do veterinary fees and sausage
OL,4,Arolls vary in price across London?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We use national pricing across most of
OL,7,Four shops however, this can vary in
OL,8,Fcertain locations where costs are
OL,9,Fhigher than average, such as travel
OL,10,Fhubs," they told the BBC in a
OL,11,Fstatement.
